L.notes.append('Searched in the English columns: every book name (Matthew, Mark, Luke, John, Acts, Romans, Corinthians, Galatians, Ephesians, Colossians, Titus, Peter, Hebrews, Genesis, Exodus, Isaiah, Psalm, Timothy, Paul, St.) and every «Book N, N» pattern inside Apology IX, LC IV and AC IX. Apology IX is a short article: the only English reference in it is Matt. 28, 19 (the other numbered references found in the search window belong to Art. X on the Lord\'s Supper and are not counted).')
